config DRIVER_BLK_SDDF
	bool "sDDF block device"
	default n
	depends on PLAT_CARRELS
	depends on LIBUKSDDF
	depends on LIBUKBLKDEV
	help
	  Block device driver backed by the sDDF block client interface.
	  The driver supports one asynchronous request queue and uses the
	  client data region as a pool of 4 KiB transfer buffers.
